WEBVTT

01:34.750 --> 01:36.750
This is the knife.

01:37.210 --> 01:39.540
Could you tell me a bit more about it?

01:40.040 --> 01:45.210
Sure. The curse cuts up anything that touches it.

01:45.670 --> 01:50.000
The old man who owned it touched it by accident,

01:50.290 --> 01:52.960
and it cut his arm straight in half,
all the way up to his torso.

01:53.540 --> 01:56.540
His family brought him and the knife here for the service,

01:56.830 --> 01:58.880
but honestly, I can't figure this thing out.

01:59.580 --> 02:00.960
You're a fellow practicioner.

02:01.170 --> 02:04.580
Think you can handle it, Oswald?

02:05.880 --> 02:07.500
I'll give it a shot.

02:08.500 --> 02:15.130
But I hope this means if you hear anything about that
mummified left arm of ours, you'll contact me right away.

02:15.380 --> 02:16.630
Yeah, of course.

02:17.040 --> 02:19.250
One question before you start, though.

02:19.540 --> 02:20.380
Go on.

02:21.290 --> 02:23.420
Who's this lady?

02:24.250 --> 02:27.920
A friend of mine who's also a practicioner.
She's quite famous, too.

02:28.540 --> 02:30.130
She's famous?

02:30.130 --> 02:32.880
Why don't we have her handle this matter, then?

02:33.540 --> 02:34.250
Shami-san?

02:34.920 --> 02:36.250
Already on it.

02:59.380 --> 03:00.880
That'll do it.

03:01.380 --> 03:04.170
Too dull to gut even a fish, now.

03:04.750 --> 03:07.460
You can touch it now... Holy shit.

03:07.750 --> 03:08.880
I told you.

03:09.460 --> 03:11.330
Right, we'd better be off.

03:12.130 --> 03:13.380
Let us know if you hear anything.

03:13.380 --> 03:14.790
H-hold on a sec!

03:15.880 --> 03:20.000
You of all people should be fine, but I gotta ask.

03:21.290 --> 03:25.000
You haven't been replaced, have you?

03:29.790 --> 03:35.250
Would you like me to tell you where to find
every last nudie mag you hid in the temple?

03:35.580 --> 03:36.750
Yeah, you're fine...

03:37.500 --> 03:41.710
It's good you checked. Those of us with the gift
are in the most danger of being cursed.

03:42.710 --> 03:47.420
But this is why I'm always very careful,
and in constant contact with everyone.

03:48.250 --> 03:49.670
Rest assured, it won't happen to me.

03:49.880 --> 03:52.250
It's been happening a lot recently.

03:52.580 --> 03:54.500
One of my buds got swapped the other day.

03:54.960 --> 04:00.790
We took care of it, but we never found his spirit,
so he ended up dead.

04:01.380 --> 04:07.130
Don't worry. I never travel alone,
so I've always got a buddy to protect me!

04:07.420 --> 04:09.380
W-well, good.

04:15.710 --> 04:20.080
You hear that, Shami-san? People keep getting replaced.

04:21.790 --> 04:24.210
Sounds like it.

04:24.580 --> 04:30.000
They've got no idea spirits
can read their memories once they're inside.

04:30.420 --> 04:33.460
They can talk their way through any conversation.

04:34.130 --> 04:37.250
Unless they really screw up, no one will notice.

04:37.750 --> 04:42.380
And these spirits can even use the powers
the person once possessed.

04:43.540 --> 04:48.170
And the more powerful they are,
the more likely they'll walk themselves into trouble.

04:49.380 --> 04:52.040
With their enemies' abilities at their disposal,

04:52.040 --> 04:56.250
it's all too easy for those evil spirits
to find new bodies for their friends to take over.

04:57.710 --> 05:01.130
Speaking of which, how are you enjoying that new body?

05:01.540 --> 05:05.080
You saw what I did. It's plenty powerful.

05:05.630 --> 05:09.880
Now I can give you and that old man Nankobo
a run for your money.

05:10.080 --> 05:11.790
That's wonderful.

05:12.630 --> 05:14.830
I'll keep asking around for leads.

05:15.580 --> 05:16.540
Where are you headed?

05:16.920 --> 05:19.460
I'm gonna get this set up.

05:16.920 --> 05:19.920
<b>ANIMOSITY WARD</b>

05:20.380 --> 05:23.380
Keep your guard up. You can never be too careful.

05:23.750 --> 05:26.130
Please, this body will make things all too easy.

05:35.420 --> 05:38.920
Here we are. The Old I Watergate.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.540
Look over there.

05:43.540 --> 05:44.040
Huh?

05:49.040 --> 05:53.080
Wait, Kei-kun, I feel like
we've seen her somewhere before.

05:53.250 --> 05:53.960
