06:14.540 --> 06:27.040
<b>MEET THE INCREDIBLE SPIRITUALIST</b>

06:14.540 --> 06:27.040
<b>NAGIKO SHAMI</b>

06:14.830 --> 06:17.630
Spiritual Researcher Nagiko Shami.

06:18.170 --> 06:22.670
She hosted a ghost show about ten years ago,
where she'd do readings at haunted places,

06:22.880 --> 06:25.460
or make bonfires out of ghostly photos.

06:25.830 --> 06:29.210
She's made a comeback in online videos recently.

06:30.250 --> 06:35.500
She went viral after exorcising a taxi driver
who was acting weird at the Z Cemetery.

06:36.250 --> 06:41.790
The Z Cemetery? That's an A-Rank haunt on our list.

06:41.790 --> 06:43.130
She beat us to it!

06:43.830 --> 06:46.250
Looks like she beat us to another one, too.

06:47.330 --> 06:51.750
She also went to the Old K Tunnel
and made it back alive.

06:53.630 --> 06:56.250
That one's an S-Rank.

06:56.670 --> 07:00.330
This one here's an S-Rank, too, right?

07:33.330 --> 07:34.290
Hey, lady.

07:34.750 --> 07:38.170
I heard you're a super powerful medium. Prove it.

07:38.460 --> 07:40.500
The hell is wrong with this kid?

07:40.670 --> 07:42.080
WHAT?!

07:42.080 --> 07:43.670
Oh my God, Yayoi-chan!

07:43.790 --> 07:45.920
You can't just walk up to someone and ask them that!

07:45.920 --> 07:48.830
I’m so sorry, she just got excited
after hearing you were famous!

07:55.670 --> 07:57.670
Wh... whoa.

07:58.380 --> 08:01.540
For a second there, I sensed something horrible...

08:02.080 --> 08:05.290
Did you come here knowing what this place is?

08:05.460 --> 08:06.170
Yup.

08:07.670 --> 08:10.710
If you're aware of the dangers, then follow me.

08:11.920 --> 08:13.000
